  "notes": "いつまでも expresses indefinite continuation.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- いつまでも + verb (forever ~)\n- いつまでも + negative (can't ~ forever)\n- いつまでもお⟦{幸|しあわ}せ→幸せ：01420_shiawase⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ (may you be happy forever)\n\nUSAGE:\n- Positive: eternal, lasting (love, memories)\n- Negative: won't end, dragging on\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦ずっと→ずっと：00912_zutto⟧: all along, continuously\n- いつまでも: forever (emotional emphasis)\n- ⟦{永遠|えいえん}→永遠：01873_eien⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧: eternally (formal)",
